        "strategyID": "reach",
        "title": "这 20 家潜在客户，先联系哪些？",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-29T00:39:14Z",
        "version": 1,
        "body": "这 20 家都在近 30 天发布了运营岗位招聘，说明正在扩张。其中 8 家的招聘描述直接提到多店铺库存同步，和产品解决的问题一致。"
      },
      {
        "createdAt": "2026-10-29T02:59:14Z",
        "excerpt": "Inventory sync across two storefronts is exactly where we kept losing orders. What fixed it for us was treating one store as the source of truth and pushing changes out every few minutes, instead of syncing both ways.",
        "id": "x-c1",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "o1",
            "label": "批准，今晚发"
          },
          {
            "id": "o2",
            "label": "不发"
          }
        ],
        "recommendedOptionID": "o1",
        "status": "active",
        "strategyID": "x",
        "title": "发布回复 C1：回 Shopify 运营那条",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-29T02:59:14Z",
        "version": 1,
        "body": "原帖作者在问怎样同步两个店铺的库存，是目标客户的典型问题。回复只分享做法，不放链接。"
      },
      {
        "createdAt": "2026-10-29T02:47:14Z",
        "excerpt": "The tensioner note makes sense: two tensioners per track set by eye could easily leave the sides different. Since it's open source, a short note on how to check both sides match before driving could save other builders the same chase.",
        "id": "x-m1",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "o1",
            "label": "批准，C1 之后发"
          },
          {
            "id": "o2",
            "label": "不发"
