        "recommendedOptionID": "o1",
        "status": "active",
        "strategyID": "x",
        "title": "发布回复 M1：回开源机器人那条",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-29T02:47:14Z",
        "version": 1,
        "body": "作者在分享开源履带机器人的组装记录。回复是关于张紧器调节的建议，能建立好感，但不直接带来客户。"
      },
      {
        "createdAt": "2026-10-29T02:44:14Z",
        "excerpt": "Castle joints on a walnut bed are a good test, since the exploded view has to show which way each notch faces. Does the skill check that the cut sheet and the build steps use the same part names?",
